WEBVTT

00:18:29.531 --> 00:18:31.792
saremo in grado di dire:

00:18:31.792 --> 00:18:33.536
"L'abbiamo fatto,

00:18:33.536 --> 00:18:35.942
E poi abbiamo ballato."

00:18:36.872 --> 00:18:44.747
(Video) (Musica)

00:18:44.757 --> 00:18:46.827
SG: Grazie.

00:18:46.827 --> 00:18:51.734
(Applausi)

00:18:51.738 --> 00:18:52.946
MP: Grazie.

00:18:52.946 --> 00:18:53.724
(Applausi)